The DiGee MCMD is configured to run on Teensy 4.0.

Implementing the use of the IntervalTimer class for Teensy https://www.pjrc.com/teensy/td_timing_IntervalTimer.html

All libraries necessary are included, except core Teensy libraries, instead please refer to Teensy installation tutorial here: https://www.pjrc.com/teensy/tutorial.html 

The non-Teensy libraries included can also be installed using the Arduino IDE Library Manager, which is recommended instead. They are included just in case.
